    {
      "number": "221",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "parts": [],
      "display": "例如写出前5项，并给出通项公式（$n\\ge1$）：\na) $10,20,30,40,50,\\ldots$，$u_n=10n$；\nb) $10,100,1000,10000,100000,\\ldots$，$u_n=10^n$；\nc) $2,4,6,8,10,\\ldots$，$u_n=2n$；\nd) $2,4,8,16,32,\\ldots$，$u_n=2^n$。\n各通项在 $n=1$ 时给出规定的首项，并满足原递推公式。",
      "derivation": "Constant increments yield 10+10(n-1)=10n and 2+2(n-1)=2n; constant multipliers yield 10*10^(n-1)=10^n and 2*2^(n-1)=2^n. Check initial term and recurrence for all n>=1.",
      "notes": "原题同时要求可变长度的前几项和通项公式，保留完整示例与理由，不只判通项来冒称全任务自动判分。"
